<DIV ALIGN="center">
<H1>Constitution</H1>
</DIV>
<P>
<B>Charter</b>
<P>
Out in the darkness we wait.  Our cold hands grip your neck.  As your last breath 
escapes your lips, you suddenly realize you are in the grasp of the Damned.<P>
We are the dark, the plaguebringers, the sowers of hate, and the caretakers of chaos.
We are The Conclave of the Damned.<P>
An evil Guild on the Seventh Hammer server.  Role-playing is strongly encouraged but 
not mandatory. No begging is allowed so if you are looking for free stuff look some other place.  
Our rules are simple, and our loyalty absolute.
<P>
<B>Rules</b>
<P>
<OL>
<LI>No Begging. We strongly encourage helping guild mates but blatant begging will not be tolerated.
*the Definition of begging is as follows.  The blatant asking and or bothering of others for Money, 
Item's, or favors. This is in Tells and/or Guild chat.</LI>
<LI>This guild is for Evil members only (i.e. you must be of a evil race and/or class to join), 
if you wish to join and do not fit into this definition you must submit a story explaining what 
made you turn evil and you must be approved by a majority of the officers with the Dark Warlord 
having the final say.</LI>
<LI>The killing of Evil Guards or the helping of those who are killing the Evil Guards is 
prohibited and a bannable offense.</LI>
<LI>Auctioned Items should be sold to guild members first and at the going rate or cheaper. 
(if you price gouge your guild mates, we will find out)</LI>
<LI>No Kill stealing, and no looting of corpses that have been connected to you.</LI>
</ol>
All disputes between members should be handled by combat, all discipline will be at the discretion 
of the officers and enforced by the Black Hand.
<P>
